    "page.connType.shadow.p.calculate-your-four-totem-animals-then": "Ƙididdige dabbobin totem huɗu naka, sa’an nan ka yi birgin jerin zaɓi don mutanen da ke raba wannan nau’in haɗe da kai.",
    "page.connType.shadow.btn.totem-connections-directory": "Jerin Totem Connections",
