    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.section-label.connection-type": "Nau’in Haɗe",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.h1.mirror-opposite": "Madubi Mai Saba",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.opposites-on-the-zodiac-wheel-six": "Sabani a kan dabaran zodiac - alamomi shida daban, suna fuskantar juna kai tsaye a fadin da'irar. Manufa don nuna makafi da koyo daga ra'ayi daban-daban.",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.opposites-on-the-zodiac-wheel-six.2": "Sabani a kan dabaran zodiac - alamomi shida daban, suna fuskantar juna kai tsaye a fadin da'irar. Waɗannan haɗin gwiwar sun dace don nuna kanmu da ganin maɓoɓin juna - saboda a zahiri suna fuskantar kishiyar shugabanci da kuke! Wannan na iya haifar da wasu zazzafan muhawara, amma idan dai kun kawo isashen girmamawa ga teburin, akwai abubuwa da yawa da za ku koya a nan daga madubinku - ku biyu za ku iya ganin abubuwan da ɗayan ba zai iya ba, don haka idan dai kun amince da juna kuma ku yi aiki da bangaskiya mai kyau, wannan na iya zama mai taimako sosai da kyakkyawar alaƙa don samun. Tabbas zai kiyaye abubuwa masu ban sha'awa, saboda babu shakka za su sami ra'ayi daban-daban fiye da ku, wani lokacin kuma sun bambanta da ba ku ma tunanin zai yiwu!",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.h3.other-connection-types": "Wasu nau’in haɗe",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.li.rainbow": "<a href=\"connection-rainbow.html?v=20260807\">Bakan Gizo</a>",
