    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.h2.find-mirror-opposite-matches": "Nemo Madogara na Madubi Masu Saba",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.calculate-your-four-totem-animals-then": "Ƙididdige dabbobin totem huɗu naka, sa’an nan ka yi birgin jerin zaɓi don mutanen da ke raba wannan nau’in haɗe da kai.",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.btn.totem-connections-directory": "Jerin Totem Connections",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.btn.totem-animals-calculator": "Na’ura Mai Lissafin Dabbobin Totem",
    "page.connType.values-trine.section-label.connection-type": "Nau’in Haɗe",
    "page.connType.values-trine.h1.values-trine": "Values Trine",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to": "Ƙimar Rarraba - Dukan dabbobin suna cikin Triangle Dabaru iri ɗaya, don haka sau da yawa kuna magana da yare ɗaya idan ya zo ga fifikon rayuwa.",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to.2": "Ƙimar Rarraba - Dukan dabbobin suna cikin Ma'auni guda ɗaya: Ƙarfi & Daraja, Tsaro & Kwanciyar hankali, Wahayi & Idealism, ko Aminci & Haɗuwa. Waɗannan haɗin gwiwar mutane ne waɗanda ke magana da yare ɗaya da ku, masu ƙima. Suna da fifiko iri ɗaya idan ya zo ga yadda za a bi da rayuwa - ko dai neman iko da fasaha a cikin kasuwanci, ko neman zaman lafiya da salon rayuwa mai sauƙi. Waɗannan su ne mutanen da ba dole ba ne ku bayyana kanku sau da yawa, saboda sun riga sun kasance a kan ku, don haka yana iya zama mai kyau ga kowane irin dangantaka: kasuwanci ko jin dadi, iyali ko abota. Cool gudu :)",
    "page.connType.values-trine.h3.other-connection-types": "Wasu nau’in haɗe",
    "page.connType.values-trine.li.rainbow": "<a href=\"connection-rainbow.html?v=20260807\">Bakan Gizo</a>",
