    "page.connType.values-trine.h2.find-values-trine-matches": "Nemo Madogara na Values Trine",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.calculate-your-four-totem-animals-then": "Ƙididdige dabbobin totem huɗu naka, sa’an nan ka yi birgin jerin zaɓi don mutanen da ke raba wannan nau’in haɗe da kai.",
    "page.connType.values-trine.btn.totem-connections-directory": "Jerin Totem Connections",
    "page.connType.values-trine.btn.totem-animals-calculator": "Na’ura Mai Lissafin Dabbobin Totem",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.section-label.connection-type": "Nau’in Haɗe",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.h1.same-as-me": "Same-As-Me",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.p.the-same-totem-animal-at-the": "Dabbobin totem iri ɗaya a ginshiƙi ɗaya - ko dabba ɗaya a cikin “ring” daban-daban waɗanda aka haifa 12, 24, ko 36 shekaru baya. Jagora iri ɗaya; ban mamaki mutane daban-daban.",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.p.the-same-totem-animal-at-the.2": "Dabbobin totem iri ɗaya a matakin iri ɗaya - wanda ke raba jagorar Ruhu, Hankali, Zuciya, ko Jikinku daidai. Hakanan yana iya zama mutane daga 'rings' daban-daban don yin magana - a wasu kalmomi mutanen da aka haifa 12, 24, 36, ko wasu mahara na shekaru 12 ban da ku. Misali, Ni Wuta ce Damisa haifaffen 1986, amma ina da wasu ban mamaki Damisa 'yan uwa da abokan arziki da aka haifa a daban-daban Damisa rings - daya daga cikin kawuna Ruwa Damisa haife a 1962, dana ne Ƙarfe B1, da kuma dalibai da yawa B4. Abokan zama Duniya Tigers haifaffen 1998. Na kuma sami abokan aiki da aka haife su a cikin shekarar itace Damisa, 1974. Yana iya zama sanyi ganin yadda dabbobinka aiki a lokacin da suka samu daban-daban elemental dandano charging su makamashi a wasu mutane. Hakanan yana iya zama mai kyau don nemo mutanen da aka haife su a daidai ranar haihuwa kamar ku, don haka suna da jagororin dabba iri ɗaya, ko aƙalla 3 cikin 4 idan dabbar sa'a ta bambanta, kuma don ganin yadda suka zaɓi su yi wasa da hannunsu daban fiye da yadda kuka zaɓa don kunna naku - irin kamar yadda tagwayen '' iri ɗaya' sun bambanta ta fuskoki da yawa, amma a wasu yankuna da yawa. 'Yancin zaɓi abu ne mai ƙarfi, kuma wannan haɗin yana nuna hakan a sarari. Dabbobin haihuwa da ke jagorantar su iri ɗaya ne, amma mutanen da ake yi musu ja-gora sun fito gaba ɗaya kuma suna da ban mamaki :)",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.h3.other-connection-types": "Wasu nau’in haɗe",
