    "page.conn.p.the-same-totem-animal-at-the": "Kanna totem eranko ni kanna ọwọn - tabi kanna eranko ni kan yatọ si \"ring\" bi 12, 24, tabi 36 years yato si. Awọn itọsọna kanna; iyanu orisirisi awọn eniyan.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.label.i-agree-to-list-my-display": "Mo gba lati ṣe atokọ orukọ ifihan mi, awọn ẹranko totem mẹrin, agbegbe iyan, intoro, ati imeeli iyan ni itọsọna gbangba yii lẹhin atunyẹwo.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.p.page-build-20260883": "Page build 20260883",
