    "page.conn.p.each-person-has-four-totem-animals.2": "Olukuluku eniyan ni awọn ẹranko totem mẹrin - Ẹmi, Ọkàn, Ọkàn, ati Ara. A ṣe afiwe ọwọn kanna laarin eniyan meji ati Dimegilio awọn ipo asopọ marun.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.label.i-agree-to-list-my-display.2": "Mo gba lati ṣe atokọ orukọ ifihan mi, awọn ẹranko totem mẹrin, agbegbe iyan, intoro, ati imeeli iyan ni itọsọna gbangba yii lẹhin atunyẹwo.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.p.page-build-20260883.2": "Page build 20260883",
    "page.connType.rainbow.section-label.connection-type": "Irú Àsopọ̀",
    "page.connType.rainbow.h1.rainbow": "Àràbó",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.yin-and-yang-companions-each-one": "Yin and Yang awọn ẹlẹgbẹ - ọkọọkan mu awọn awọ otitọ ti ẹranko miiran jade bi prism, nitorinaa ọrọ naa \"Rainbow.\" Sisopọ toje ti o tọsi ni igbakugba ti o ba pade rẹ.",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.yin-and-yang-companions-each-one.2": "Yin and Yang awọn ẹlẹgbẹ - Olukuluku n mu awọn awọ otitọ ti ẹranko miiran jade bi prism, nitorinaa ọrọ naa \"Rainbow\" - pẹlu iru asopọ yii, iwọ yoo rii ara wọn gaan! O jẹ sisopọ toje, ati pe o yẹ ki o ṣe akiyesi nigbakugba ti o ba pade rẹ! Yoo gba ọpọlọpọ iṣẹ ti ara ẹni ṣaaju ki ọpọlọpọ eniyan ti ṣetan fun iru asopọ yii - lẹhinna, irisi kikun ti awọn awọ otitọ rẹ yoo wa ni ifihan ni gbogbo igba, nitorinaa o dara julọ rii daju pe gbogbo awọn oju rẹ ni didan ati didan!",
    "page.connType.rainbow.h3.other-connection-types": "Àwọn irú àsopọ̀ mìíràn",
